[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1117","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1152","title":"BeOS Browser IRC Client URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BeOS r5 pro 及之前版本中集成的 Browser IRC 客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 URL 的 IRC 消息，触发客户端解析异常导致崩溃或无法响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前官方已停止维护该操作系统，建议用户升级至不受影响的版本或更换 IRC 客户端软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1152"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16Z","remediation":"升级 BeOS 至 r5 pro 以上版本，或更换为第三方 IRC 客户端（如 Vision IRC）。如无法升级，可在防火墙或网关层面过滤异常长 URL 的 IRC 消息（长度超过 1024 字节的 PRIVMSG/NOTICE 消息）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0203.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1152.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1152.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1152","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1152.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1152.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1152.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2000/CVE-2000-1152.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1152.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1152.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1152.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1116","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1151","title":"Abisoft Baxter IRC客户端 BeOS平台 URL远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BeOS 平台上的 Baxter IRC 客户端（r5 pro 及更早版本）存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 URL 的消息，导致 Baxter IRC 客户端崩溃或无法响应，从而造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响 BeOS 系统上使用该 IRC 客户端的用户。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 5.0，属于中危漏洞，目前尚无官方补丁发布。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1151"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 BeOS r5 pro 及更早版本上的 Baxter IRC 客户端，改用其他支持 BeOS 的 IRC 客户端（如 Vision IRC）。由于 BeOS 已停止维护且厂商不再提供安全更新，建议将系统迁移至 Haiku OS 或使用其他现代操作系统，并在网络层面配置防火墙规则限制 IRC 端口的异常长 URL 流量作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0203.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1151.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1151","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1151.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1151.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1151.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5606c11566e9461a0d44f0944086969cb6810ef1/2000/CVE-2000-1151.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1151.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1151.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1151.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1115","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1150","title":"Xavier Ducrohet Felix 2.3 IRC 客户端长 URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BeOS R5 Pro 及更早版本中使用的 Felix IRC 客户端存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 URL 的消息触发该漏洞，导致 Felix IRC 客户端崩溃或停止响应，无法正常提供 IRC 聊天服务。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，攻击条件简单，只需构造一条特制消息发送给受害者即可。该漏洞影响 Xavier Ducrohet Felix 2.3 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1150"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:15Z","remediation":"升级 Felix IRC 客户端至 2.3 以上版本（如仍在使用 BeOS 系统）；由于 BeOS 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Haiku OS 并使用其自带或更新的 IRC 客户端。临时缓解措施可在 Felix 客户端配置中限制单条消息 URL 长度不超过 1024 字节，或改用其他 IRC 客户端（如 IRCle）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0203.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1150.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1150.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1150","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1150.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1150.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1150.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2000/CVE-2000-1150.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1150.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1150.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27ef30b72e2251e5a09f792eabf726cf380537a6/api/2000/CVE-2000-1150.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1113","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1146","title":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags format as specified.<value>Recourse ManTrap 1.6 蜜罐系统中存在拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可利用该产品对 /proc/self 目录路径处理不当的缺陷，通过在 /proc/self 目录及其父目录之间反复切换并执行 ls、pwd 等命令，触发应用程序异常终止，导致服务无法正常响应，从而造成系统可用性部分丧失。该漏洞影响 Recourse ManTrap 1.6 及 1.6.1 版本。攻击条件要求攻击者已在目标主机上拥有本地访问权限，但无需任何身份认证即可实施攻击。利用成功仅会影响服务的可用性，不会造成敏感信息泄露或数据完整性破坏。Recourse Technologies 已就该漏洞发布安全公告，建议受影响用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1146"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:15Z","remediation":"升级 ManTrap 至最新可用版本以修复该漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可通过修改系统配置限制普通用户对 /proc/self 目录的访问权限，或使用 chroot/容器隔离运行 ManTrap 以限制攻击面。作为临时缓解措施，可调整文件系统挂载选项屏蔽对 /proc 敏感目录的遍历访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349791405580&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1913","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5528","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b20bfc143159985d72e06c22492fa07d41b61e71/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1146.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6319d796586e052c159b72f452c1df7e848d6f10/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1146.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1146","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1146.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1146.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9fd71f49ddb336418f3080efb7e4e9379a9d3617/2000/CVE-2000-1146.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1146.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1146.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1146.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-1146.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1113.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1112","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1145","title":"Recourse ManTrap 任意数据文件读取与篡改漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 是一款用于检测 ManTrap 根kit 的安全工具，但其自身存在严重的安全漏洞。当攻击者获取到系统根权限时，可以利用该工具的 crash 或 fsdb 等功能访问 /dev/mem 和原始磁盘设备等低级系统资源。这种权限绕过行为允许攻击者深入读取系统内存，识别 ManTrap 进程的存在并对其进行操控，甚至可以直接修改任意数据文件。攻击者通过这种手段可以隐藏自己的根kit活动、破坏安全检测机制、窃取敏感数据或破坏系统完整性。该漏洞影响早期版本的 Recourse ManTrap 产品，攻击者需要首先获取系统控制权，但一旦达到该条件，后果将极其严重。美国国家安全局曾在2002年披露过类似类型的漏洞，充分暴露了基于root权限的安全检测工具本身可能被逆转为攻击工具的风险。当前尽管该产品已基本退出历史，但类似的设计缺陷仍广泛存在于其他安全工具中，提醒安全从业者必须对权限管理进行更严格的验证和隔离。（58字）","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1145"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:15Z","remediation":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 已停止维护，厂商 Recourse Technologies 未发布修复补丁。建议立即迁移至 GMER、RootkitRevealer 或 chkrootkit 等仍在维护的现代反Rootkit工具，并完整扫描系统；如暂时无法替换，应卸载 ManTrap 的 crash 和 fsdb 工具，通过 sysctl 配置 kernel.yama.ptrace_scope=2 限制进程访问 /dev/mem，并在内核启动参数中加入 \"iomem=relaxed\" 限制或挂载 /dev/mem 为只读，以阻止未授权读取原始磁盘设备。同时建议检查系统中是否存在未授权root访问，消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349791405580&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5950","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1145.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1145.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1145","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1145.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1145.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fa386d759f2a771540ca69b5fc06cb6091dcd950/2000/CVE-2000-1145.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1145.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1145.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1145.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-1145.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1110","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1143","title":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 蜜罐系统在 Solaris 系统上隐藏前 4 个运行进程的特性，导致本地攻击者可通过枚举进程列表发现前 4 个进程被隐藏，从而识别出自己处于蜜罐环境中。该漏洞影响运行 Recourse ManTrap 1.6 的 Solaris 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限（AV:L），通过枚举进程列表观察前 4 个进程被隐藏的异常现象，即可推断当前环境为蜜罐系统，从而规避检测或调整攻击策略。CVSS 评分 2.1（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属于低危本地信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1143"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14Z","remediation":"建议升级 PHP-Nuke 到 5.0 及以上版本（建议升级至最新稳定版 8.4.5 或更高版本），或升级到 PHP-Nuke 5.0 及以上版本修复 Reviews 模块的跨站脚本漏洞。若暂无法升级，可临时禁用 Reviews 模块（在 admin.php 中禁用 Reviews 模块），或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）配置 XSS 防护规则过滤 <script>、onerror 等恶意脚本标签，同时建议对用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码转义处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349791405580&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5473","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1143.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1143.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1143","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1143.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1143.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/23d445ba1c2af3be2483c95d0fd3ff73d6b1329c/2000/CVE-2000-1143.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1143.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1143.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1143.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1143.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1107","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1142","title":"Recourse ManTrap 蜜罐信息泄露漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 版本存在特定处理缺陷，当攻击者进入进程的当前工作目录 /proc/self/cwd 并执行 pwd 命令时，工具会异常崩溃并泄露错误信息。这个漏洞影响 Early 2000 年代的网络安全监控工具，攻击者无需认证即可利用该漏洞来检测目标系统是否为蜜罐系统，从而规避安全监控。在蜜罐/沙箱环境中，这种探测行为可能导致安全分析人员的误判，影响整体安全态势感知。漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，分类为低危，但其信息披露性质可能被恶意攻击者用作安全防御系统探测工具，在网络安全监控场景中具有潜在危害。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1142"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14Z","remediation":"建议立即停用 Recourse ManTrap 1.6 等已停止维护的老旧蜜罐产品，迁移至现代主动维护的蜜罐解决方案（如 Cowrie、Dionaea、Honeypot.py 等）。若短期无法迁移，可通过以下缓解措施降低风险：1) 在蜜罐系统中挂载 procfs 时添加 hidepid=2 参数（mount -o remount,hidepid=2 /proc），限制非特权用户访问 /proc/self/cwd；2) 使用 chroot 或容器技术隔离蜜罐 shell 环境，禁止攻击者执行 pwd 等探测命令；3) 在网络层面部署流量镜像与行为分析，替代依赖单一蜜罐系统的检测逻辑。参考厂商后续回复（Bugtraq 20001107）建议升级至修复版本，但该产品已于 2002 年随 Recourse 被 Symantec 收购后停止维护，无可用补丁，唯一彻底方案为替换产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349791405580&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5949","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1142.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1142.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1142","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1142.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1142.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cf9f26fab3bbc76af663e922f8ccf4da465b1866/2000/CVE-2000-1142.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1142.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1142.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1142.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-1142.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1105","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1141","title":"Recourse ManTrap 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 蜜罐系统存在内核修改漏洞，攻击者通过查看 /proc 目录列表中缺少 \"..\" 父目录项这一特征，即可识别出目标系统为 ManTrap 蜜罐环境。该漏洞影响 Recourse ManTrap 1.6 版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限（本地访问 AV:L）且无需认证即可通过查看 /proc 目录列表识别蜜罐环境，属于信息泄露类漏洞（CVSS 2.1，C:P/I:N/A:N）。攻击者利用内核修改导致 /proc 目录结构异常这一特征，通过简单的目录遍历操作即可识别蜜罐环境，从而规避蜜罐监控并调整攻击策略。Recourse 公司已停止维护该产品，建议迁移至现代蜜罐解决方案。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1141"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Recourse ManTrap 1.6 并迁移至现代蜜罐解决方案（如 Cowrie、Dionaea、Conpot 等）。若必须继续使用，可通过重新编译内核恢复 /proc 目录中 \"..\" 条目的显示，或在内核参数中启用 procfs 完整显示（如启用 hidepid=0），但需注意这会降低蜜罐隐蔽性。建议尽快部署现代主动防御蜜罐系统替代已停止维护的 ManTrap 产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349791405580&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5473","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1141.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1141","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1141.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1141.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3846f10533f33b6add488388e63fdc90a48d6484/2000/CVE-2000-1141.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1141.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0a07da1560249b2b9027d6c5d908418017bb7740/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1141.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1141.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-1141.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1105.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1104","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1138","title":"Lotus Notes R5 S/MIME 邮件完整性验证绕过漏洞","description":"Lotus Notes R5 客户端 R5.0.5 及更早版本的 S/MIME 邮件处理机制存在安全缺陷，当攻击者在邮件传输过程中篡改经过 S/MIME 签名的电子邮件内容时，客户端无法向用户发出有效警告，导致用户无法察觉邮件已被修改。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞实施中间人攻击，拦截并篡改邮件内容，可能造成敏感信息泄露、数据完整性破坏或进一步的社会工程攻击。该漏洞影响 Lotus Notes R5 系列客户端，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1138"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14Z","remediation":"升级 Lotus Notes 客户端至 R5.0.6 或更高版本（该版本已修复 S/MIME 签名验证缺失问题）。如无法升级，建议改用支持完整 S/MIME 签名校验的邮件客户端（如 Outlook、Thunderbird），并在邮件网关层面启用 TLS 传输加密以防止中间人篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97370725220953&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1925","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1138.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1138.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1138","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1138.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1138.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2000/CVE-2000-1138.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1138.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1138.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1138.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1138.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1103","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1136","title":"Debian GNU/Linux elvis-tiny 文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 中 elvis-tiny 文本编辑器 1.4-10 版本之前存在符号链接攻击漏洞，本地用户可通过创建指向其他用户文件的符号链接，诱导 elvis-tiny 在编辑临时文件时覆盖目标文件，导致文件完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Debian GNU/Linux 及可能其他 Linux 发行版中的 elvis-tiny 编辑器，攻击向量为本地访问，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 4.6（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），危害等级中等。攻击者可利用此漏洞覆盖其他用户文件，可能导致权限提升或数据破坏。建议升级至 elvis-tiny 1.4-11 或更高版本，或改用 vim/nano 等安全编辑器替代。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1136"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 elvis-tiny 到至少 1.4-11 版本， Debian 用户可通过 `apt-get update && apt-get install --only-upgrade elvis-tiny` 执行升级。如系统无 elvis-tiny 包，可安装 vim/nano 等安全文本编辑器替代方案。如无法立即打补丁，可通过修改默认权限 (`chmod 755 /usr/bin/elvis-tiny`) 和移除必要符号链接访问权等方法进行缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97502995616099&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1984","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5632","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1136.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1136.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1136","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1136.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1136.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b057d3bcc2a1da38f6284c6c5f111734c51b6e6/2000/CVE-2000-1136.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1136.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1136.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1136.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1136.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1102","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1135","title":"Debian GNU/Linux fshd 本地符号链接攻击文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 中 fshd（fsh daemon）存在符号链接竞争条件漏洞。该守护进程在处理文件操作时未充分验证符号链接目标路径，本地攻击者可通过在目标文件路径上预先创建符号链接，诱使 fshd 误将数据写入受害者用户的文件，实现文件覆盖。此漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1135"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:13Z","remediation":"安装 fsh 1.0.post.4-1 或更高版本（该版本已修复符号链接竞争条件），可通过 Debian 安全公告 20001130 获取更新。由于 fsh 已从 Debian 仓库移除且停止维护，建议彻底卸载 fsh 并迁移至 SSH 进行远程命令执行（如 `ssh -f` 替代 `fsh`）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对 fshd 的调用权限，避免在多用户环境下使用 fshd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001130","http://www.osvdb.org/7208","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5633","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1135.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1135.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1135","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1135.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1135.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9dff795a9a7b58dca025b22ebdb342ecc8354f50/2000/CVE-2000-1135.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1135.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1135.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1135.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1135.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1101","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1133","title":"Authentix Authentix100 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Authentix Authentix100 存在URL路径解析安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者通过在受保护目录的URL中插入一个点号（.）即可绕过身份认证机制，未经授权访问受限资源。该漏洞源于服务器对URL路径的规范化处理不当，未能正确过滤或校验用户输入的路径分隔符。攻击者无需任何凭证即可通过网络远程利用此漏洞，导致敏感信息泄露，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1133"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:13Z","remediation":"升级到 Authentix100 5.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 URL 路径解析中的点号绕过问题。由于升级免费，用户应从 http://www.flicks.com/authentix100 获取最新版本。如无法升级，可在 IIS 层面配置 URL 重写规则，拒绝包含异常路径分隔符的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97353881829760&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97362374200478&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1907","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1133.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1133.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1133","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1133.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1133.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1133.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5100979f8c44200a9b65976c3ddceb21c01ae6d/2000/CVE-2000-1133.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1133.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1133.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1133.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1099","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1131","title":"Bill Kendrick GBook 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Bill Kendrick 开发的 GBook 留言簿 CGI 程序（gbook.cgi）存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 _MAILTO 表单变量中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 GBook 所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可导致服务器被完全控制。建议升级到最新版本或对用户输入进行严格过滤。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1131"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:12Z","remediation":"立即停用 gbook.cgi 或升级到已修复版本。如无法升级，编辑 gbook.cgi 源码，在 `_MAILTO` 变量传递给 shell 命令前使用 Perl 的 `quotemeta()` 函数或正则替换过滤掉 `;` `|` `&` `` ` `` `$` `(` `)` 等 shell 元字符，并启用 Perl taint 模式（在脚本首行添加 `#!/usr/bin/perl -T`）。作为临时缓解措施，在 Web 服务器配置中限制 gbook.cgi 的执行权限或直接移除该脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1940","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5509","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1131.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef