网络边界部署独立反垃圾邮件网关作为补充防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0324.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1993","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1130.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1130.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1130","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1130.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1130.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1130.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2000/CVE-2000-1130.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1130.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1130.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1130.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1097","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1128","title":"McAfee VirusScan 4.5 不安全路径搜索代码执行漏洞","description":"McAfee VirusScan 4.5 的默认配置中未对 ImagePath 变量使用引号进行包裹，导致系统搜索路径被错误设置。该漏洞影响安装了 McAfee VirusScan 4.5 的 Windows 系统。具备本地访问权限的攻击者可利用此漏洞，在 C:\\Program Files 目录中放置特洛伊木马程序 \"common.exe\"，由于搜索路径配置不当，系统可能优先加载并执行该恶意程序而非 McAfee 的正规组件，从而获得未经授权的程序执行权限，进而对系统机密性、完整性和可用性造成部分影响，CVSS 评分 4.6。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1128"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:12Z","remediation":"标签之间。<value>升级 McAfee VirusScan 至 4.5 补丁版本或更高版本以修复 ImagePath 注册表项未加引号问题。如暂无法立即升级，可手动修改注册表中 McAfee 相关服务的 ImagePath 值，在路径前后添加英文双引号，例如将 `C:\\Program Files\\McAfee\\VirusScan\\...` 改为 `\"C:\\Program Files\\McAfee\\VirusScan\\...\"`，确保 Windows 能正确解析包含空格的完整路径，防止本地用户在 C:\\Program Files 目录下放置名为 `common.exe` 的特洛伊木马程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q4/0073.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1920","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d01cc3b51c3d46ca313e02b941d9469d580d931b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1128.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1128.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1128","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1128.json","https://github.com/EasyHook/EasyHook/blob/16f641c8e2197b01095f548c94dcbe696a816a05/EasyHookNative.autopkg","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1128.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/52ddd3fbe097d381a58d14aae3f8c42a9146b190/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1128.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-1128.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1128.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1128.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/